[{"title":"次邹希贤买鱼不得三首衍为渔翁问答六诗 其一 问渔翁","author":"姚勉","text":"拨剌金鳞竞跃渊，决非明月载空船。\n有鱼不供行人买，莫是渔翁不爱钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36709,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次邹希贤买鱼不得三首衍为渔翁问答六诗 其五 渔翁问","author":"姚勉","text":"见说京粮旧日籯，学将湖舫入江撑。\n而今归去应无事，芦笋蒿芽锦鳜羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36710,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次邹希贤买鱼不得三首衍为渔翁问答六诗 其四 渔翁答","author":"姚勉","text":"渺渺澄江湛碧虚，风帆一幅挂轻蒲。\n吾钩岂直鱼虾设，入钓文王未解无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36711,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次邹希贤买鱼不得三首衍为渔翁问答六诗 其二 渔翁答","author":"姚勉","text":"游鱼惊饵总沉渊，一任携竿晚立船。\n今世有钱人总爱，渔翁岂独不贪钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36712,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次邹希贤买鱼不得三首衍为渔翁问答六诗 其六 答渔翁","author":"姚勉","text":"茅屋无金可满籯，湖边小艇却堪撑。\n纵无介甫鱼羹饭，也学东坡饱菜羹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36713,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过麻子湖遇逆风有作 其五","author":"姚勉","text":"世道如斯决意归，此心不怕八风吹。\n吾生忠信无休日，天下风波有定时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36714,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过麻子湖遇逆风有作 其四","author":"姚勉","text":"兹行已误出山来，得就莼鲈亦快哉。\n造物莫嫌归未是，故教风力倒吹回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36715,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过麻子湖遇逆风有作 其三","author":"姚勉","text":"来去船皆欲便风，天心岂解两相从。\n侬帆一顺渠应怨，不若从渠且苦侬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36716,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过麻子湖遇逆风有作 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"自喜扁舟载月明，涉湖底事不宜轻。\n象痕深没风仍顺，今日天公亦世情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36717,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过麻子湖遇逆风有作 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"我自甘心欲背时，舟行一任逆风吹。\n去帆今日誇轻捷，只恐前滩也怨迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36718,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别西湖 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"渐是梅花雪片时，雁书底苦趣归期。\n虽然未赏西湖雪，犹及梅花第一枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36719,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别西湖 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"别了东坡更乐天，重来荐菊又明年。\n欲行且止真难去，再泛西湖半日船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36720,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张道夫惠大小砚五走笔戏谢","author":"姚勉","text":"蛾眉五砚列窗前，渍墨磨丹总可怜。\n试向莺莺主人问，大鬟何似小鬟妍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36721,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"花下闻莺","author":"姚勉","text":"吹花不起午风轻，懒絮閒丝飏暖晴。\n诗料满前收不尽，海棠花下又闻莺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36722,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陈和卿四绝 其四","author":"姚勉","text":"空斋长夏永如年，莺啭林阴鹭水田。\n只好更寻棋一局，莫孤花影午时天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36723,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陈和卿四绝 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"梁燕无声昼掩扃，若为消此画堂清。\n急呼觅句陈无己，莫撚吟髭且一枰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36724,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陈和卿四绝 其三","author":"姚勉","text":"蚤里溪人又馈鱼，未容归兴动莼鲈。\n祇今更办开蔬供，君若来迟釜恐无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36725,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和陈和卿四绝 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"绝交久是孔方兄，赊得村醪小款迎。\n君岂真无食肉相，夜来蔬笋太僧清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36726,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和姚榷院送茉莉韵","author":"姚勉","text":"清甚冰葩淡不妆，能从盛暑到秋凉。\n琼楼合著移春槛，却向山斋供净香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36727,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和龚宗谕五绝 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"多少抡魁岂独今，道心谁胜利名心。\n只知晁董前头立，何似周程乐处寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36728,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和龚宗谕五绝 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"吾侪从仕为家邦，岂羡科名世少双。\n激浪须看岿柱立，犯颜安可畏郎撞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36729,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和龚宗谕五绝 其三","author":"姚勉","text":"学不求名况为官，官甜初不似儒酸。\n无能富贵都磨灭，直作浮云一样看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36730,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和龚宗谕五绝 其四","author":"姚勉","text":"闻仅二知虽赐也，道传一贯必参乎。\n己私克尽融天理，表里通明月在壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36731,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和龚宗谕五绝 其五","author":"姚勉","text":"名下惟知不可居，诲言终日反三隅。\n爱人以德今忠献，莫道前贤久已无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36732,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏蜂","author":"姚勉","text":"百花头上选群芳，收拾香腴入洞房。\n但得蜜成甘众口，一身虽苦又何妨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36733,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤山纳凉","author":"姚勉","text":"双鹭窥荷弄水香，一蝉嘶柳送斜阳。\n京华凉处惟湖上，更有孤山第一凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36734,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孤山闻木犀","author":"姚勉","text":"湖面清风拂酒杯，异香一片自天来。\n明知不是荷花了，金粟漫山昨夜开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36735,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沿江买鱼不得询之则前此多为官船所强取故有亦言无因成三绝 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"江行安可食无鱼，问著笭箵总道虚。\n底事官船渠不卖，从来污吏喜侵渔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36736,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沿江买鱼不得询之则前此多为官船所强取故有亦言无因成三绝 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"分明翠笼掩金鳞，鼓枻飘飘不可亲。\n底事官船渠不卖，官人不是爱鱼人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36737,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先贤八咏 其四 和靖探梅","author":"姚勉","text":"孤山养孤鹤，宜与梅为邻。\n处士若轻出，梅花应笑人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36738,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南台","author":"姚勉","text":"一片荒碑立翠苔，空馀基址郁崔嵬。\n此台湮废浑闲事，山北如今未有莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36739,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弈棋有感","author":"姚勉","text":"奕秋鸿鹄未须惊，一著才差败一枰。\n不信但来茅屋里，纸棋盘上看输赢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36740,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"思江南笋蕨","author":"姚勉","text":"先生亟去理山斋，笋蕨春甜味正佳。\n一夜东风催变绿，笋吹成竹蕨成柴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36741,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日即事","author":"姚勉","text":"梁燕无声半掩关，昼长人静觉春閒。\n閒中却有农歌起，声在晴烟绿处山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36742,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昼步江村","author":"姚勉","text":"碧空一片水云飞，竹里人家午唱鸡。\n江路雨晴芳草润，杖藜行遍水东西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36743,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洪长老惠藤杖","author":"姚勉","text":"高僧挑月一枝藤，惠我登山脚便轻。\n澒洞风尘豺虎恶，从今险路稳支撑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36744,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送京学林申甫 其一 小隐","author":"姚勉","text":"林飞倦翼已知还，小隐何妨且住山。\n未始便为长往计，回头魏阙五云间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36745,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送京学林申甫 其二 萱堂","author":"姚勉","text":"萱草忘忧底解忘，慈亲鹤发坐高堂。\n羡君有此忘忧得，如我添忧万斛强。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36746,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周县尉满秩归 其四","author":"姚勉","text":"自古高安欠学宫，新庠赞立竟谁功。\n青青子佩争弦诵，总在先生化育中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36747,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周县尉满秩归 其五","author":"姚勉","text":"方今天下少贞廉，廉有如公岂暂淹。\n见说东皇思柄用，姓名已向玉瓶拈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36748,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周县尉满秩归 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"清浮寒露在冰壶，一节三年更不渝。\n莫道来时琴鹤在，而今琴鹤一齐无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36749,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周县尉满秩归 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"采棒年来可怕人，先生一念只慈仁。\n吏奸却立晴冰晓，民瘼皆苏化日春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36750,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送周县尉满秩归 其三","author":"姚勉","text":"乡户生愁役破家，买田助义息纷哗。\n从今闾里皆安业，男课犁锄女绩麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36751,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送欧阳","author":"姚勉","text":"祠宇重修复旧观，喜知家世未灰寒。\n祇今陛下如仁祖，安得先生作谏官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36752,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送曾苍山","author":"姚勉","text":"平生共饮西江水，今日相逢南浦云。\n玉洁日光湖上宰，与君有旧是斯文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36753,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"除夕前一日湖中望西山有感","author":"姚勉","text":"西山青处近家乡，先世衣冠正此藏。\n明日千门俱祀岁，坟前谁拜一炉香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36754,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仁山","author":"姚勉","text":"山为仁者乐，况复字为仁。\n坐与兹山对，静中天地春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36755,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海棠一夜为风吹尽三首 其三","author":"姚勉","text":"海棠自是百花仙，霞袂霓裳下九天。\n昨夜诏归红玉阙，但留翠幄锁晴烟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36756,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海棠一夜为风吹尽三首 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"不作天开锦幄红，却成急雪舞回风。\n多应欲衬吟春步，绣出香裀展径中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36757,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海棠一夜为风吹尽三首 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"翠底红娇得几时，不甘飞动雪胭脂。\n问天借醒书窗眼，为报东风且慢吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36758,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海棠落尽叶间犹见数花","author":"姚勉","text":"狼藉吹花一夜风，锦裀织就锦机空。\n叶间尚有馀春在，深处娇藏四五红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36759,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离京留题蒋店 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"琼瑶为室玉为台，隔岸群花照水开。\n莫道此楼容易上，天香曾到此中来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36760,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"离京留题蒋店 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"閤门传旨放朝参，归觐亲庭晓整骖。\n葵藿丹心犹恋恋，五云缭绕望宫南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36761,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿珠桥见龙上天","author":"姚勉","text":"升天旧说有神龙，今睹蜿蜒在目中。\n莫道已腾霄汉了，愿施霖雨作年丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36762,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄感山二诗僧 其二 寄半颠","author":"姚勉","text":"读君桑苇疏篱句，知得犹存用世心。\n拄杖借将来解虎，不须深卧白云深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36763,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄感山二诗僧 其一 寄雪樵","author":"姚勉","text":"欲听茶鼎转风松，底事云房白昼封。\n应在山中采樵去，雪深何处问行踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36764,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题茶山","author":"姚勉","text":"文献风流想故家，玉川室迩已人遐。\n何时细赏文清竹，与客同煎陆羽茶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36765,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题章贡刘氏丽晓楼","author":"姚勉","text":"玉虹翠浪雪堂诗，底事山光晓独奇。\n看取阴云都捲处，直须天下大明时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36766,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章钓仙吹铁笛善医眼与齿相说法尤高 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"穿云裂石笛声秋，兴在江湖一钓舟。\n贯柳无鱼囊有药，直钩应是太公钩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36767,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章钓仙吹铁笛善医眼与齿相说法尤高 其三","author":"姚勉","text":"眼眵书册隐庐蜗，健论谁听落齿牙。\n说起元龙湖海志，扁舟又欲出芦花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36768,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"章钓仙吹铁笛善医眼与齿相说法尤高 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"严于治齿要如军，治眼当如爱护民。\n此术尽堪为世用，钓鱼船上岂无人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36769,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绿阴","author":"姚勉","text":"红满芳蹊绿满丛，未须惆怅怨东风。\n绿阴正耐经秋看，不比花才十日红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36770,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菊节宿白沙次友人韵","author":"姚勉","text":"野市难为侧帽纱，家山犹远雪鸥沙。\n退之尚有衣堪准，悔不留君醉菊花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36771,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其七","author":"姚勉","text":"冰襟玉袖几交游，尽自风流胜子猷。\n有兴可乘应不尽，定无门外便回舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36772,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其三","author":"姚勉","text":"磥砢擎云十丈松，冰髯不剪照珑松。\n晓窗明眼山前雪，犹似巡檐看玉龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36773,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其五","author":"姚勉","text":"近郊胜处小云居，一水如龙凑佛庐。\n长记钓蓑披雪去，砖炉温酒煮溪鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36774,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其一","author":"姚勉","text":"近水新栽一巷梅，而今雪里想齐开。\n只愁夜后花幽独，谁与携筇踏月来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36775,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其二","author":"姚勉","text":"此君应似旧平安，瘦节森然最耐寒。\n万叶琼瑶光照眼，梦披鹤氅倚栏干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36776,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其八","author":"姚勉","text":"万个琅玕绕舍青，风声相和读书声。\n蛛丝近日应侵几，孤负虚窗照雪明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36777,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其九","author":"姚勉","text":"帐窣销金旧党家，未知清处在煎茶。\n便应归去烧松叶，细碾枪旗煮雪花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36778,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其十","author":"姚勉","text":"欲折梅花寄故人，驿无来使草成茵。\n轻风细雨分寒暖，已是江南数日春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36779,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其六","author":"姚勉","text":"倚空银管立嵯峨，看雪须登窣堵波。\n一览琼田三万顷，分明掌上见山河。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36780,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪中雪坡十忆 其四","author":"姚勉","text":"对床风雨饱曾听，听雪敲窗更自清。\n旧日拥炉联句乐，而今攲枕打篷声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36781,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪后同友人观梅","author":"姚勉","text":"檐珠沥沥雪初晴，酒滴寒槽杂溜声。\n旋釂梅花斟夜月，人间那得个般清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36782,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游下竺园","author":"姚勉","text":"穿洞扳岩日几回，瘦筇欲去复徘徊。\n园丁亦怪经行数，笑道今朝官又来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36783,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游冷泉亭宿四圣观","author":"姚勉","text":"昼日追凉到冷泉，晚风呼酒醉湖边。\n醉中兴懒休归去，试叩丹房借榻眠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36784,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游湖","author":"姚勉","text":"云锦香中著艇撑，烟霞高处步筇登。\n寺逢好处都游遍，身似西湖过夏僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36785,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖上钓者","author":"姚勉","text":"荷风湖面晓，垂钓柳阴中。\n何日能蓑笠，扁舟此兴同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":36786,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]